---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Emadram and the Ruflo developer blog.">
  <section class="space-y-8">
    <header class="space-y-4">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-200">About</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">
        Building with focus and curiosity.
      </h1>
      <p class="max-w-2xl text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        This is the home for my personal notes, curated links, and project write-ups.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/80 p-6 dark:border-slate-800/60 dark:bg-slate-900/40">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Mission</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">
          Ship carefully, share clearly.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          The goal is to document decisions, highlight the work behind each release, and keep
          everything readable for future me.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/80 p-6 dark:border-slate-800/60 dark:bg-slate-900/40">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">What you will find</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">
          Personal updates and curated links.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          Blog posts, news highlights, and project snapshots collected in one place.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr]">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/80 p-6 dark:border-slate-800/60 dark:bg-slate-900/40">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Author</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Emadram</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          Developer focused on thoughtful systems, clean interfaces, and steady iteration.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/80 p-6 dark:border-slate-800/60 dark:bg-slate-900/40">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Contact</p>
        <div class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm">
          <a
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700 transition hover:text-sky-700 dark:text-slate-200 dark:hover:text-sky-200"
            href="https://github.com/Emadram"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            GitHub
          </a>
          <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Email: add later</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
